{
"#name"
:
{
"tmux"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"增强型 tmux 命令"
,
"en"
:
"Enhanced tmux command"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"对 tmux 的常用操作进行封装与增强，提供更友好的命令接口与默认行为，简化会话（session）、窗口（window）和窗格（pane）的创建、管理与切换。"
,
"en"
:
"An enhanced wrapper around tmux that simplifies common workflows. It provides more convenient commands and sensible defaults for creating, managing, and switching sessions, windows, and panes in the terminal."
}
,
"#tip:note"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"Extends 'tmux' options.\nSee `tmux --help` for more information.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"已继承 'tmux' 参数选项与指令.\n可通过 `tmux --help` 命令查看更多信息.\n"
}
]
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"不带参数或 `:session` 都走 quickenter —— 不存在自动创建，存在直接 attach。\n"
,
"en"
:
"No args or `:session` both go through quickenter — auto-creates if missing, attaches if exists.\n"
}
]
,
"--setup"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"初始化 x-cmd tmux 配置（首次使用执行一次）"
,
"en"
:
"Initialize x-cmd tmux config (run once on first use)"
}
}
,
"--clear"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"从 ~/.tmux.conf 移除 x-cmd 引导行"
,
"en"
:
"Remove the x-cmd bootstrap line from ~/.tmux.conf"
}
}
,
"--man"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"查看 tmux 手册"
,
"en"
:
"Show the tmux manual"
}
}
,
"--runmain"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"把剩余参数原样透传给系统 tmux"
,
"en"
:
"Pass remaining args straight through to system tmux"
}
}
,
":"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"quick enter tmux session (e.g `:<session>`)"
,
"cn"
:
"快速进入 tmux 会话 (e.g `:<session>`)"
}
,
"#nospace"
:
true
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"tmux session id"
,
"cn"
:
"tmux 会话 id"
}
,
"#exec:stdout"
:
"xrc tmux && ___x_cmd_tmux___ls_session_name"
}
}
,
"load"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"从 JSON/YAML 配置文件加载 tmux 布局（默认查找 ws.{yml,json} / tmux.{yml,json}）"
,
"en"
:
"Load tmux layout from a JSON/YAML config file (default: ws.{yml,json} / tmux.{yml,json})"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"tmux configure path"
,
"cn"
:
"tmux 配置文件路径"
}
,
"#exec"
:
"___x_cmd_advise__file"
}
}
,
"theme"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"tmux 主题管理（ls / use / unuse / current / --app）"
,
"en"
:
"Manage tmux themes (ls / use / unuse / current / --app)"
}
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"列出可用主题"
,
"en"
:
"List available themes"
}
}
,
"use"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"切换到指定主题"
,
"en"
:
"Switch to a theme"
}
}
,
"unuse"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"卸载当前主题"
,
"en"
:
"Revert to default theme"
}
}
,
"current"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示当前主题"
,
"en"
:
"Show current theme"
}
}
,
"--app"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"交互式主题选择"
,
"en"
:
"Interactive theme picker"
}
}
}
,
"msg"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"简写：原生 tmux 的 display-message"
,
"en"
:
"Shortcut for native tmux's display-message"
}
}
,
"pop"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"简写：原生 tmux 的 display-popup"
,
"en"
:
"Shortcut for native tmux's display-popup"
}
}
,
"src"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"简写：原生 tmux 的 source-file"
,
"en"
:
"Shortcut for native tmux's source-file"
}
}
,
"prompt"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"简写：原生 tmux 的 command-prompt"
,
"en"
:
"Shortcut for native tmux's command-prompt"
}
}
,
"confirm"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"简写：原生 tmux 的 confirm-before"
,
"en"
:
"Shortcut for native tmux's confirm-before"
}
}
}

